# P-006-6: the legacy flexible box and its line clamp in servo mode (ui4me 015 TXT-4, register UP-10; lane L-TXT, AUTHORISATIONS E-029): `display: -webkit-box` and `-webkit-inline-box` parse, `-webkit-box-orient` (the `-moz-box-orient` longhand and its alias) and the `-webkit-line-clamp` shorthand are enabled behind the pref layout.css.line-clamp.enabled, and `adjust_for_webkit_line_clamp` runs: a `-webkit-box` with a line clamp and a vertical orientation computes to `flow-root` (`Display::FlowRoot` is available in servo mode); the size of ComputedValues grows by the XUL struct pointer (232 -> 240)
# Applies to: servo/stylo @ 37c1ed3b707c8f333304de2107c13b68fbc1057c after P-006-1, P-006-2, P-006-3, P-006-4 and P-006-5 (root of the checkout, `patch -p1`)
